<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Your Language Model is Its Own Critic: Reinforcement Learning with Value Estimation 
<br class="ltx_break">from Actor’s Internal States</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yunho ChoiGraduate School of Data ScienceSeoul National University
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
