Full results are in Table <a href="#A4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ D.3 Comparisons on Multiple Domains and Models ‣ Appendix D Comparison to Policy-model Scale Critic Model ‣ Your Language Model is Its Own Critic: Reinforcement Learning with Value Estimation from Actor’s Internal States" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</figcaption>
